flowchart TD
    Start([Authority: GET /identifiers/identifier]) --> AuthCheck[Authenticate user via API key]
    AuthCheck --> RoleCheck{User has AUTHORITY role?}

    RoleCheck -->|No| Deny403[Return 403 Forbidden]
    RoleCheck -->|Yes| BuildQuery[Build IdentifiersQuery\nid, countryCode, mode,\ndangerousGoodsIndicator, forceBroadcast]

    BuildQuery --> LocalQuery[Query local PostgreSQL\nSELECT FROM consignments\nWHERE vehicle_plate = identifier\nAND vehicle_country = ... AND status = active]

    LocalQuery --> LocalCount{local results count?}

    LocalCount -->|count > 0| HasLocalResults{forceBroadcast = true?}
    LocalCount -->|count = 0| NoLocalResults{forceBroadcast = true?}

    HasLocalResults -->|No| ReturnLocalOnly[Return local results only\nNo broadcast to other gates]
    HasLocalResults -->|Yes| DoBroadcast[Broadcast to all ONLINE gates]

    NoLocalResults -->|No| DoBroadcast
    NoLocalResults -->|Yes| DoBroadcast

    DoBroadcast --> FetchOnlineGates[gateRegistry.online\nExcludes: OFFLINE, DISABLED, own gate]

    FetchOnlineGates --> OpenSSE[Open SSE stream to authority\nHTTP 200 text/event-stream]

    OpenSSE --> SendLocalGateEvent[event: gate\ngateId=eu-ee31, responseTimeMs=N]

    SendLocalGateEvent --> HasLocalForStream{local results > 0?}

    HasLocalForStream -->|Yes| StreamLocalConsignments[Stream local consignments\nevent: consignment for each result]
    HasLocalForStream -->|No| WaitRemote[Wait for remote gate responses]

    StreamLocalConsignments --> WaitRemote

    WaitRemote --> RemoteResponse[Receive remote gate response\nor error/timeout]

    RemoteResponse --> SendGateEvent[event: gate\ngateId=eu-fi01, responseTimeMs=N]

    SendGateEvent --> HasRemoteResults{remote consignments present?}

    HasRemoteResults -->|Yes| StreamRemoteConsignments[Stream remote consignments\nevent: consignment for each]
    HasRemoteResults -->|No| CheckAllDone{All gates responded?}

    StreamRemoteConsignments --> CheckAllDone

    CheckAllDone -->|No| WaitRemote
    CheckAllDone -->|Yes| SendComplete[event: complete\nClose SSE stream]

    SendComplete --> End([Response complete])
    ReturnLocalOnly --> SSELocal[Open SSE stream\nStream local results\nSend complete event]
    SSELocal --> End
    Deny403 --> End

    style DoBroadcast fill:#ff9,stroke:#cc6
    style LocalCount fill:#9f9,stroke:#060
    style HasLocalResults fill:#9f9,stroke:#060
    style NoLocalResults fill:#9f9,stroke:#060
    style Deny403 fill:#f99,stroke:#900
